comments.body:
The message now just restates the assertion. We could use a conditional `BOOST_CHECK_EQUAL` instead:

```diff
-    BOOST_CHECK_MESSAGE(is_combo || parse_priv->ScriptSize() == scripts[0][0].size() / 2, "Invalid ScriptSize()");
+    if (!is_combo) BOOST_CHECK_EQUAL(parse_priv->ScriptSize().value(), scripts[0][0].size() / 2);
```

(`.value()` also makes a missing size fail explicitly.)

